  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently, you need to rely on gesture weight to get the trigger values through GestureRightWeight, and GestureLeftWeight, and only when the gesture is 1, i.e. Fist.\nIn my opinion, this is poorly thought out, and we should be able to instead just fetch the raw trigger values without needing to rely on gesture weights.",
